		{
			description: [
				"Create teaches visually. Hover a component in JEI or your inventory and hold W to watch its animated Ponder scene. Use the mouse wheel to step through it slowly."
				"When a machine is confusing, Ponder it before spending materials."
				"Ponder the component, then build a tiny exposed test rig. Confirm direction, RPM, stress capacity, input face, and output face before hiding shafts or committing the machine to a decorated workshop."
				"Create's design language is motion you can read. The workshop guild values a slower machine that teaches its own operation more than a compact tangle that only its absent builder understands."
			]
