			title: "Workshop Course: Compare Processing Methods"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 8.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["775E6DB58C79670F"]
			description: [
				"Build a short belt with an input, two filtered destinations, and an overflow chest. Compare funnels, tunnels, chutes, and filters through Ponder before choosing which block controls each transition."
				"Test matching, non-matching, full-output, and stopped-belt cases. Automation is not complete until unexpected items have somewhere safe to go and a jam remains visible."
				"Use this bench to prototype factory routes before hiding belts under floors, walls, roofs, or decorative casings. The most reliable filter is one whose rule another player can inspect, test, and clearly explain in a few seconds."
			]
			id: "38C0A973AA067B08"
			rewards: [{
