			title: "Workshop Course: Filtered Logistics Bench"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 10.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["38C0A973AA067B08"]
			description: [
				"Add an obvious clutch, gearshift, redstone link, or source control that stops the chosen machine without dismantling it. Label normal state, maintenance state, and what must be emptied first."
				"Verify that shutting down does not strand items over lava, trap a player on a contraption, drain a tank into overflow, or leave a train blocking a public crossing. Restart from an empty and a partially loaded state."
				"Place guards around saws, drills, crushers, and moving assemblies while preserving maintenance access. A safe factory anticipates mistakes instead of relying on everyone remembering invisible hazards."
			]
